@baseUrl = http://localhost:5050/api/dhantrading
@dhanApiKey =

### Scan current-expiry NSE stock futures (read-only; requires a saved, logged-in Dhan account)
GET {{baseUrl}}/scanner/stock-futures
X-Dhan-Api-Key: {{dhanApiKey}}

### Read recent background 3-minute NSE F&O breakout signals
GET {{baseUrl}}/scanner/breakouts
X-Dhan-Api-Key: {{dhanApiKey}}
